<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-09-08T16:27:41.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18754,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "Have you noticed that AI often creates the most common version of images? \n\nIt's not always the version YOU had in mind?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3736a365548adba05a21e8f0b333ec1f-three characters.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-AI-a478b96e-eaef-446f-86ca-7020790e476c",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Let's find out why!",
            "x": 53,
            "y": 90,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-043dd68d-7f75-4d8b-9f31-4a4bb5cf31be"
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "typing": true
      },
      {
        "text": "It's because AI generates new images using patterns in the examples it had in its training. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3736a365548adba05a21e8f0b333ec1f-three characters.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-043dd68d-7f75-4d8b-9f31-4a4bb5cf31be",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Dragon Examples",
            "x": 23,
            "y": 76,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-1c5a8409-54be-442a-b574-264ddbe90103",
            "width": 18
          },
          {
            "text": "Unicorn Examples",
            "x": 53,
            "y": 76,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-831e32d4-4cf5-4c52-957e-60557f5f9ba1",
            "width": 19
          },
          {
            "text": "Superhero Examples",
            "x": 78,
            "y": 76,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-f413d57e-721d-416c-a86c-3d3c275f210b",
            "width": 21
          },
          {
            "text": "Next",
            "x": 93,
            "y": 92,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-a575c100-cf83-4bab-8b5c-226a11e20471",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "showContinueButton": false,
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "typing": false
      },
      {
        "text": "**The AI studied millions of dragon pictures**\n\nWhat do you notice about most of these dragons? When you type \"dragon,\" it draws the most common one, not the only one that could exist.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1ca2b8e2cd0e17405550a5d5f793eec3-dragon data.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-1c5a8409-54be-442a-b574-264ddbe90103",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Back",
            "x": 14,
            "y": 80,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-043dd68d-7f75-4d8b-9f31-4a4bb5cf31be",
            "width": 9
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "**The AI studied millions of unicorn pictures.**\n\nWhat do you notice about most of these unicorns? When you type \"unicorn,\" it draws the most common version it learned — not the only one possible.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2c533a258249f30a257bbd2c13e7a24c-Unicorn data.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-831e32d4-4cf5-4c52-957e-60557f5f9ba1",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Back",
            "x": 13,
            "y": 87,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-043dd68d-7f75-4d8b-9f31-4a4bb5cf31be",
            "width": 17
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "**The AI studied millions of superhero pictures.** \n\nWhat do you notice about most of these superheroes? When you type \"superhero,\" it draws the most typical one it has seen — not the only kind there is.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/257a6a560d09946ef4bfede3903d69df-heros data.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-f413d57e-721d-416c-a86c-3d3c275f210b",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Back",
            "x": 7,
            "y": 85,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-043dd68d-7f75-4d8b-9f31-4a4bb5cf31be",
            "width": 13
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "AI learns which details tend to appear together, so it treats them as a bundle. Ask for one piece, and you will likely get the whole set. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6d82a005d8fbf8cfa0a2381b63cfd47c-detail bundles.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-a575c100-cf83-4bab-8b5c-226a11e20471",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Dragon Details",
            "x": 20,
            "y": 80,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-8a2a3f96-1d60-44f0-9f50-8e90ac4f252b",
            "width": 22
          },
          {
            "text": "Unicorn Details",
            "x": 52,
            "y": 80,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-17de75d7-a74c-4f35-8380-b9648dfbe333",
            "width": 23
          },
          {
            "text": "Superhero Details",
            "x": 85,
            "y": 80,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-3c3b6c67-5cfe-466b-bbc1-6b0a8d8eb94b",
            "width": 26
          },
          {
            "text": "Next",
            "x": 91,
            "y": 95,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-4c1ab7ee-66a0-47e5-aac7-38003a653060"
          }
        ],
        "typing": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Scales, wings, and fire almost always showed up together in what the AI studied. So it treats them like a set — grab one, and the others come along automatically. Want a dragon without wings? You might have to say so.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c0c277ee536c01e1ee2f1796e06f0f06-dragon set.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-8a2a3f96-1d60-44f0-9f50-8e90ac4f252b",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Back",
            "x": 16,
            "y": 89,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-a575c100-cf83-4bab-8b5c-226a11e20471",
            "width": 11
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "White coat, rainbow mane, and a glowing horn almost always showed up together in what the AI studied. The AI bundles them automatically. Want a black unicorn with no rainbow mane? You might have to say so.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8788a1ea3983a166d0f3ff9552f823f6-unicorn set.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-17de75d7-a74c-4f35-8380-b9648dfbe333",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Back",
            "x": 16,
            "y": 84,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-a575c100-cf83-4bab-8b5c-226a11e20471",
            "width": 11
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Capes, masks, and muscles almost always showed up together. The AI learned to bundle them as a set. Want a superhero without a cape? You might have to say so.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0ad0ff25f7928b4e87c8ace54131dc30-hero set.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-3c3b6c67-5cfe-466b-bbc1-6b0a8d8eb94b",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Back",
            "x": 8,
            "y": 88,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-a575c100-cf83-4bab-8b5c-226a11e20471",
            "width": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "**You** decide if it's good enough!\n\nThe AI is not creative, nor is it confused. It did exactly what it was built to do: guess the most typical answer. That first image is just a starting point. If it's not what you pictured, add more detail and try again.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5e7ccf54702e916496c24aa1b4bd99fa-end.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-4c1ab7ee-66a0-47e5-aac7-38003a653060",
        "showContinueButton": true
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "true",
    "display_name": "Learn",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Learn how AI makes images",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/5c645a7e28fbfe0f28387ba6557d16f9-Gemini_Generated_Image_zh9ivazh9ivazh9i.jpeg"
  },
